00:42:53,900 --> 00:42:56,340
because they're convinced that what they come up in their mind

746
00:42:56,440 --> 00:42:57,740
will entertain the people on the screen.

747
00:42:57,840 --> 00:42:59,240
And that's what their job is to do.

748
00:42:59,340 --> 00:43:00,840
They firmly believe in everything they do.

749
00:43:00,940 --> 00:43:02,220
They come up with an idea.

750
00:43:02,320 --> 00:43:03,520
They give it to the producers.

751
00:43:03,620 --> 00:43:04,820
It either works or it doesn't.

752
00:43:04,920 --> 00:43:06,420
And then we finally see it on the screen.

753
00:43:11,560 --> 00:43:14,220
Finding clever ways to meld the world

754
00:43:14,221 --> 00:43:17,720
of real spy technology with the magic of the movies

755
00:43:17,820 --> 00:43:19,120
has always been an art.

756
00:43:23,720 --> 00:43:26,960
It is a creative blend of skill and imagination,

757
00:43:27,060 --> 00:43:29,760
finding the best way to take high-tech gadgets

758
00:43:29,860 --> 00:43:31,880
and use them in fictional stories.

759
00:43:35,480 --> 00:43:39,820
